WEBVTT

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:31.980
Please stop!

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.980
My father wouldn't have left 
that much debt!

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:38.040
We'll hear you out back at the office.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.320
Please stop!

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:40.720
Stop struggling, damn it!

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:42.230
Riku Rei!

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:47.560
<i>Please use this inheritance 
that I've left you</i>

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:50.630
<i>and protect her from the enemy.</i>

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:51.870
Hold it!

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.540
What?

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:56.560
Don't touch her!

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:58.260
Suigin, no!

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:01.760
Let go of her!

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:05.080
Ow...

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:11.030
<i>And create a new future 
for the both of you.</i>

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.480
Hey, what the hell is your problem?!

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:17.510
<i>I'm counting on you, Riku Suigin.</i>

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:19.670
Please!

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:20.910
Make him stop!

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:25.780
I'll go wherever you want me to. 
I'll do whatever you say.

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:28.420
As long as you get the point.

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:32.310
Hey, that's enough. Let's get out of here.

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:36.470
Yeah. Damn it... 
Causing us trouble like that...

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:39.720
Wait...

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:44.880
I'll pay that debt...

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:50.110
Suigin Pledges Himself to Riku Rei!

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:54.520
Five hundred million? You?

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:57.410
Just wait! I'll bring it to you right now!

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:01.180
This time... This time, I'll...

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:07.950
It is not possible to convert 
in-game currency into real money.

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.210
Riku Suigin

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:14.470
Even if I have all of this money here...

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:14.470
Saved Wealth

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:19.760
There's no point if I can 
only use it in the game!

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:26.550
Again...

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.040
Again, I'm just completely...

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.180
Suigin!

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:33.480
Riku Rei!

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:36.360
Thank you, Suigin.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:40.520
It made me really happy that 
you tried to save me.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:43.660
I'll never forget...

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:48.900
I'll never forget you, 
no matter where you are.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.460
Thank you, Suigin!

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:09.680
All right.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.900
What a strange little brat.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:21.490
Well, I'm sure we taught him a
 lesson on how tough the real world is.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:24.860
What's wrong?

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.270
Hey, that's...

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:32.160
S-Suigin!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.410
Riku Rei!

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:42.620
What, seriously?

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.970
What the hell is that brat thinking?

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.550
Hey, stop!

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.700
Stop it!

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:50.640
Suigin!

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.560
Riku Rei! Just wait, Riku Rei!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.850
Suigin! Suigin!

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:58.730
No matter where you go,

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:02.150
I'll save you, no matter what!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.810
So please, wait for me!

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:05.200
I...

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:08.160
I'll wait for you!

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.920
I'll wait for you forever!

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:13.780
I'll be waiting, Suigin!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.410
Oh, jeez...

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.300
Go die, or something.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.470
Suigin!

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:30.130
You stay out of this.

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:40.180
Suigin!

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:47.910
I wonder if he died.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.700
Who cares?

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.820
You're right.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.380
Wh-Who the hell are you?

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:01.500
Where the hell did you come from?

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:05.880
The name's Silicon. Totems...

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:07.610
Silicon.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:26.860
What did you do to Riku Rei?

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:29.030
Let go of her!

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:31.790
You must be Riku Suigin.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.840
Temujin-sama has a message for you.

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:37.860
"I'll be waiting for you in <i>Grave Buster</i>."

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:42.420
I've relayed the message, Riku Suigin.

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:53.840
He disappeared?

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:12.580
I guess it won't work.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.120
It doesn't seem like it's 
out of batteries, though.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.700
He spent his life...

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:30.010
I'm not my father's biological daughter.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:31.220
But I am also your grandfather.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:34.800
<i>Riku Yuuki...</i>

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:44.170
<i>What is this thing called 
</i>Grave Buster<i> that he created?</i>

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:50.370
<i>Where did that guy... take Riku Rei?</i>

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:52.420
<i>I don't know...</i>

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:56.110
<i>What am I supposed to...</i>

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:07.500
Wh-Wh-Wh-Who are you?

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:10.420
My name is Twin Star.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:13.430
Uh, er, um, what are you doing here?

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:19.800
You're so mean. I'm here 
because you called me here.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:23.810
Er, uh, hey! I think you've 
got the wrong room.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.560
You summoned me, my master.

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:30.200
ID: Riku Suigin.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:43.170
Inside Grave Buster

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:43.170
Stage 34

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:59.110
This is...

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:02.630
<i>Grave Buster?</i>

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.750
Sh-She...

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:10.270
She called me "master,"

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:13.070
but who the heck is she?

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:20.030
My eyes...

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:21.660
...are spinning, star!

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.790
Sh-She transformed?!

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:28.720
Different location on the same stage

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:28.710
This stage is nice and quiet.

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.340
The sky is so distant.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:37.130
Looks like this is a hidden stage 
that no one's got to robbing yet.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.870
All right, let the grave robbing begin!

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:44.290
I'm so sensitive right now, twin.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:46.930
Don't touch me there, star.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:49.640
I guess this might be that 
person's true identity...

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:59.080
Do not awaken me!

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:03.870
Wh-Wh-Wh-What the heck is this?!

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:08.090
The Story Up Till Now

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:12.830
A boarding school filled with 
rich kids, Shinryou Academy.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:15.250
Among the celebrity status kids,

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:18.460
there was just one kid who was alone and 
worked while he was in school, Riku Suigin-kun.

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:21.240
His only talent is to play video games.

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:23.930
And he doesn't pay anything 
for them! I mean, he's poor.

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:27.360
Meanwhile, there is the academy's 
Madonna, Riku Rei-chan,

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:31.640
who has a world-renowned game 
designer, Riku Yuuki, as a father.

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:33.200
She's so rich!

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:38.050
Despite being terrible at it, she played the 
video game that she loved every night.

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:40.160
You sure you're getting enough sleep?

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:44.730
While playing her online game, a guy in 
a mask appears one day and saves her.

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:48.170
Judging by what his avatar looks like,
 he's a total weirdo!

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:52.230
This might've been a fateful meeting 
between the two, or maybe not.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:57.330
And then came the day when their favorite 
online game was discontinued.

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:01.370
On the last day, some weird monster 
appeared, and they lost out big time.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:02.760
Talk about a huge disappointment.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:07.130
But then, a new, ultimate game called
 <i>Grave Buster</i> was launched.

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:09.600
Just like the name suggests, 
it's a game about grave robbing.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:13.560
However, the game is apparently 
filled with a lot of secrets!

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:16.420
Though who knows if that's true or not?

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:19.780
Suigin-kun's been left with an 
inheritance of ten billion yen!

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.910
What's the true motive 
that lies behind that?

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:26.950
What's to become of Riku Rei-chan? 
Apparently everything is about to start now!

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:29.950
We're going to make sure 
you're here until the end!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.920
Next Time
Suigin's Chance Encounter With His Grandfather!

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:03.860
The Silver Guardian!
